|---|---|---|---|
| 1: Direct checkout | Full existing behavior through one operation | Rules remain together | Order and Payment supplied per call |
| 2: Preview and extension | More capability, more Interface knowledge | Shared default rules; extension knowledge spreads | Configuration, preview, Payment, and adjustment |
